# Whitelist context: everything not explicitly re-included stays out of the image.
# This is the hard guard against personal data (library.json/cache/exports) and
# secrets (env files, keystores) leaking into build context or layers.
*
!clipshelf/
!clipshelf.py
!deploy/
!requirements.txt

# Even inside included trees, never ship generated/volatile state.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-wal
**/*.sqlite3-shm
**/staging/
**/.pytest_cache/
